GOVERNMENT GUIDELINES
---------------------
This application was developed on the basis of government open-source and
open-standards guidelines: it is released under an OSI-approved licence (MIT),
its source is fully readable and editable, it uses open web standards, it has
no backend and no user accounts, it makes no third-party requests, and all
files are processed on the user's own device. Its accessibility and security
design follows GIGW 3.0 and WCAG 2.1 AA. See GUIDELINES-COMPLIANCE.md for the
checklist and for the items that still need an official audit.

